193:| loft floor | `spruce_planks` y 6 over x 62..67 z 10..14, with the ladder hole (62, 6, 14) and a hay drop hole over the aisle (64..65, 6, 12) | barn fit-out |
209:| 3 upper | y 7 / y 8 | x 40..44, y 8..11, z 10..15 + tower room x 44..45 z 8..9 | master bedroom (front, opening into the tower room), 2 back bedrooms; 4 beds total |
240:- Fire/functional: campfire (lit true, signal_fire true), hay_block, furnace (lit), smoker (lit), iron_trapdoor (optional thin flue wall), cauldron, water_cauldron, composter, smithing_table, barrel, ladder, iron_chain, lantern, lightning_rod, white_wool, hay (hay_block bales), bell none.
